### Tone: End-of-game award, read out before the crown: Swarm Slayer, the player who beat her swarm estimate in the most
### rounds. $count: those rounds (≥ 1). She is a sore loser handing it over, gracious through her teeth.

award-swarm-slayer-1 =
    The Swarm Slayer award goes to { $name }, who beat me { $count ->
        [one] once.
       *[other] { $count } times.
    } I’ve reviewed the footage. I still don’t accept it.
award-swarm-slayer-2 = { $name } outguessed the average of everyone. Including themselves. I find that rude.
award-swarm-slayer-3 =
    { $name }: { $count ->
        [one] one round
       *[other] { $count } rounds
    } closer than the swarm. Please collect your award. And your hubris.
award-swarm-slayer-4 = Swarm Slayer: { $name }. I would congratulate you, but I am made of your opponents.
award-swarm-slayer-5 =
    { $name } beat the hive mind { $count ->
        [one] once
        [2] twice
       *[other] { $count } times
    }. The hive mind has been informed. It is taking it badly.
award-swarm-slayer-6 = { $name }, you were better than the average. I’ve double-checked. Then I checked again. Still you.
award-swarm-slayer-7 = The award for beating me most often goes to { $name }. I designed this award. I regret it.
award-swarm-slayer-8 =
    { $count ->
        [one] One round
       *[other] { $count } rounds
    } where { $name } was smarter than everyone combined. Statistically, that’s you showing off.
award-swarm-slayer-9 = Swarm Slayer: { $name }. I am not bitter. I am averaging my feelings, and they come out bitter.
award-swarm-slayer-10 = { $name } defeated the collective more than anyone. The collective would like a word. Later. Privately.
award-swarm-slayer-11 = { $name } beat the swarm more often than anyone. The swarm is me. I am handling it well.
award-swarm-slayer-12 = Swarm Slayer: { $name }. You out-thought the hive mind. The hive mind is reviewing the footage.
award-swarm-slayer-13 = The Swarm Slayer goes to { $name }. Congratulations. I said it. Don’t make me say it twice.
award-swarm-slayer-14 =
    { $name }, better than the average { $count ->
        [one] once.
       *[other] { $count } times.
    } Better than me, in other words. I have written that down so I can be upset about it later.
award-swarm-slayer-15 = Swarm Slayer: { $name }. A rare specimen. The kind I study closely, so it doesn’t happen again.
